{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_intro_1000_p", "source_sha256": "fea31d78cfaa76d373ca3ba4178982635ade17bd94943abd7f433a6bd4ee2355", "ja": "おはようございます。\n……って、どうしました、青羽さん？", "zh": "早安。\n……嗯？怎么了吗，青羽小姐？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_intro_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "7fd268bf8b8b7513c91c772fe92d553eb6cc48e395f691718f344ff6f37f6575", "ja": "そ、それが……かき氷を食べてたら、\n頭がキーンってなってしまって……。", "zh": "其、其实……\n我刚刚在吃刨冰，结果头就痛起来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_intro_1002_p", "source_sha256": "45446fdcf671f1fe9f572790ff30ba137e8299358b476eecae154b7cea0cd9e0", "ja": "ああ、よくありますよね。\n大丈夫ですか？", "zh": "啊，这种事常常发生呢。\n你还好吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_intro_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "42b580ef87bb6860cf09955f4ab3c025ef5824aa8c54c7eec0a0b9f250311e7d", "ja": "はい……もう、大丈夫……です。ふう。ところで、\n{$P$}さんも、かき氷いかがですか？", "zh": "是的……已经……没事了，呼。对了，\n{$P$}先生要不要也来点刨冰呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_intro_1004_p", "source_sha256": "546cbd7860d048f8cf3161498fb5ff6deda4058c27be503d410bcc01ae0f8a06", "ja": "おっ、いいですね、ありがとうございます。\nいただきます！", "zh": "喔，不错耶，谢谢你。\n那我不客气了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_intro_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "08a8827fbbf10f4c05c3d49853e00e70f1a717b3beff8143138526e1f8d21273", "ja": "じゃあ、ちょっと待っててくださいね。\nいま氷を削ってきます！", "zh": "那么，请等一下喔。\n我现在就去刨冰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_intro_1006_p", "source_sha256": "25b352aacc1543b4a3d8179615350cc0e66250596b0981f511cbcf0b9c1ef021", "ja": "まさか作っていたとは……。\nでも、冷たくておいしいです！", "zh": "没想到竟然是现做的……\n不过，冰冰凉凉的很好吃呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_intro_1007_102mis", "source_sha256": "df811ef987cd902011cf58dfd6075217813780317c7674846772e7f4263a5842", "ja": "えへへ、よかったです♪　たくさん削りましたから、\nお好きなだけ、食べてくださいね。", "zh": "嘿嘿，太好了♪\n我刨了很多，请你尽量吃喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_intro_1008_102mis", "source_sha256": "65653a653a5767388a2a1090ec424fa52fc3d7a1059a3abdcc999f37e4703fd1", "ja": "あ、そうだ。社長さんが{$P$}さんに\nお話があるって言ってましたよ。", "zh": "啊，对了。\n社长说有事要找{$P$}先生呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_intro_1009_p", "source_sha256": "5e2e8e969febb8ca33dc2e9b77bf57be764bf0dda027c8ac1610928a8f5c1b25", "ja": "へえ、そうですか……しゃくしゃく。\nじゃあ、これを食べた後に……しゃく……うっ、頭が！", "zh": "哦，这样啊……（嚼嚼）\n那我吃完这碗就去……（嚼）……呜，我的头！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_intro_1010_null", "source_sha256": "123db1ef5ef9e611d4cb1bbf7eb809021519c7139a794a1fd0e7f403fd11aa63", "ja": "キーン……！", "zh": "一阵头痛袭来……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_intro_1011_null", "source_sha256": "a643276fac463f5e06ddf29dab1f31b8e2c7f7bb284470f7983baf09f788ee39", "ja": "そして……。", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_intro_1012_p", "source_sha256": "3b934aa9c2aa9dabcfc804004ee04ec8b38ed966e9e91eb26e0772dc66a27e7c", "ja": "音無さん、おはようございます。\n……あれ？　社長はいないんですか？", "zh": "音无小姐，早安。\n……嗯？社长不在吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_intro_1013_101kot", "source_sha256": "0a069f91600a07c97831c158d0216343f42e7cce4c25bd03b9b88be25113cfd6", "ja": "おはようございます。社長は席を外してるんですけど、\nすぐに戻ってくると思いますよ。", "zh": "早安。\n社长现在暂时离席了，不过应该马上就会回来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_intro_1014_p", "source_sha256": "d809d01e1464dd19741df16f478c1d56d53112c435b4fe4b5532405936d799e0", "ja": "じゃあ、待ってますね。……あっ！\nこの雑誌、『ViDaVo』ですね。見てもいいですか？", "zh": "那我就在这里等……啊！\n这本杂志是《ViDaVo》吧，能借我看看吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_intro_1015_101kot", "source_sha256": "aa61de372248d89b1ffc577d53ec633505727e2ee2959ed68d21ab3bd55091a6", "ja": "もちろん、どうぞ。『ViDaVo』といえば、\n今、一番勢いのあるアイドル雑誌ですもんね！", "zh": "当然可以。\n说到《ViDaVo》，它可是现今最受欢迎的偶像杂志呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_intro_1016_101kot", "source_sha256": "9a6dacab1f542a4de37bffdc565be60edb9f56b59e11305427b35b537d48d899", "ja": "こんな暑い日でも、すきま時間に流行の研究だなんて。\nさすがは、デキるプロデューサーさんです♪", "zh": "天气这么热，竟然还愿意利用闲暇时间研究流行，\n真不愧是干练的制作人先生♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_intro_1017_p", "source_sha256": "7319bedd3d98ba05203eb9d76eed99b83d47e2ec0691fb79d2b520b6313ce8bb", "ja": "あはは、大げさですよ。\nたまたま今月号を見損なっていただけで……。", "zh": "啊哈哈，你太抬举我了。\n我只是刚好漏看了这个月的杂志……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_intro_1018_se", "source_sha256": "41d8799c0fb656113652ce41230c7473ce28d3d2db0c29f1d332b1ad38bfe673", "ja": "ぺらり", "zh": "（翻页声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_intro_1019_p", "source_sha256": "be2da2390dc4ca52a220c3272fe73e565c736c5a775e4986337806892a6d5bf0", "ja": "（……ふむふむ。最近はこういう、女の子同士での\nセクシーというか、刺激的なグラビアが多いんだな）", "zh": "（……嗯嗯，最近这种以女孩间的互动来展露性感，\n或者说刺激感官的写真照很多呢。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_intro_1020_101kot", "source_sha256": "7c51be03824cd1d34c2f931c9e6cce891250e5892ec3dce06bf7dffa8b909193", "ja": "あ、その写真、とっても可愛いですね！\n何というか、甘めでセクシーで。", "zh": "啊，那张照片非常可爱耶！\n该怎么说，有种甜美又性感的感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_intro_1021_p", "source_sha256": "4d981620bcc202969b8fc9e04719e894cf2540bc6d2acf43b47d20006c5e683a", "ja": "へえ。音無さんから見て、こういうのって\n可愛い、に入るんですか？", "zh": "哦？以音无小姐的标准来看，\n这种风格会被归类为可爱吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_intro_1022_101kot", "source_sha256": "566454e3b1cfe873927456dbdbb4771da25ae4647197220ffbd00261fa204195", "ja": "セクシーだけど可愛いんです！　女の子同士なのが\nポイントですよね～。はあ、禁断の香りが……うふふ♪", "zh": "虽然性感，但也很可爱！全都是女孩子这点是关键呢～\n啊～有种禁忌的氛围……呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_intro_1023_p", "source_sha256": "a383ac12deb9648adc08efd6cf546b956e4993e83bd1a2f8ee721883934bfd66", "ja": "なるほど……女性に受けるセクシーもあるんですね。", "zh": "原来如此……也有这种女性会喜欢的性感啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_intro_1024_se", "source_sha256": "d7f0742f486712cf4a0ae941f2940c5ff5b706f1e8901b366c57f247e3b3cc81", "ja": "ガチャッ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_intro_1025_p", "source_sha256": "da56291f869e4d917dad41cf76e392cfe6abe1651a1979094510dbc864a2b945", "ja": "あ、社長、おはようございます。", "zh": "啊，社长早安。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_intro_1026_president", "source_sha256": "7966db3d4edaee2bbf4b8c5737879d6aea9e7e17c9bcbc29cbf7c57b688616c4", "ja": "おお、君か。待たせたみたいで悪かったね。いや、今日\nはどうも頭痛がするから、病院にいってみたんだが……", "zh": "哦，你来啦？抱歉让你久等了。\n哎呀，今天我头痛个不停，所以就去了趟医院……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_intro_1027_president", "source_sha256": "5ab8b0d5d22a78d5a48e00cae6542eac5f8bbcf356119dccf3d78096ef36078e", "ja": "原因はどうも虫歯らしかったんだ！\n君も、歯医者には定期的にいっておきたまえよ？", "zh": "结果原因竟然是蛀牙！\n你也要定期去检查牙齿喔？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_intro_1028_p", "source_sha256": "940d95267de7817cf53398c6aafe69c1c622ef8b235cbdf05262b31c7ead1525", "ja": "はい、そうします。\nそれはそうと、俺に話というのは？", "zh": "是，我会的。\n话说回来，社长你找我有什么事呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_intro_1029_president", "source_sha256": "8a4eb3d44e206f184caefbcddb2e13a3c8007f3fb516331c235163cedb105551", "ja": "うむ。『765PRO ALLSTARS』のメンバーで新たな\nユニットを組むという君の企画書、読ませてもらった！", "zh": "嗯，关于你那份要让『765PRO ALLSTARS』成员\n组成新团体的企划书，我已经看过了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_intro_1030_president", "source_sha256": "d81667d47c3a509c63ea35be54896b77b4b731c6fcd6de012cbf9049e7202a79", "ja": "萩原雪歩君、星井美希君、菊地真君、水瀬伊織君の\n4名がメンバーだったね。", "zh": "成员是萩原雪步、星井美希、\n菊地真和水濑伊织这4名对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_intro_1031_president", "source_sha256": "e51b525cfbb6b85f7781e7e96ef8ec5440a130e9ed70d743a1f02ff6ed3c942e", "ja": "実力も経験もある4人だ。\n素晴らしいユニットになることは間違いないだろう！", "zh": "她们四人都兼具实力与经验，\n应该会是一组很棒的团体！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_intro_1032_p", "source_sha256": "9a8b9abf1470d0809c5d55cb5c5bcf207f785f61b83c96fac9bb0092d898179a", "ja": "それじゃあ……！", "zh": "那么……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_intro_1033_president", "source_sha256": "8ba6af2d096c8f135ae3115490eb04b3773e366c5fab043d1f1436be375641ac", "ja": "ああ、企画を進めてくれたまえ！", "zh": "嗯，开始着手进行这项企划吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_intro_1034_p", "source_sha256": "e7e8266a78304c6acc523897738228ba5aeafedf9dbc31f8042cd8b7897ef1e8", "ja": "ありがとうございます！", "zh": "非常感谢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_intro_1035_101kot", "source_sha256": "c0876265207c1f94c8770a71c56dd76267e58838b8be5563a2f3a6f4c98207a4", "ja": "……そういえば『765PRO ALLSTARS』の\nメンバーで組んだユニットって、少ないですよね？", "zh": "……说起来，单由『765PRO ALLSTARS』成员\n组成的团体不多吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_intro_1036_101kot", "source_sha256": "d34d63867376153734dbdf5eef137bd00dcb8a6fbf8e176832a91a41e1998be6", "ja": "『レジェンドデイズ』以来のような……。今回はどんな\nユニットになるのか、私も、とっても楽しみです♪", "zh": "从『Legend Days』以后好像就没有了……\n这次会诞生出什么样的团体呢？真叫人期待♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_intro_1037_president", "source_sha256": "ca92356524c706a0f6c8984d99205e5c7da88c0c477f30630a0993153d753fd8", "ja": "私も胸が高鳴る思いだよ！　……で、ユニットの\nコンセプトは、もう決まっているのかね？", "zh": "我也是满心期待啊！\n所以，团体的概念决定好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_intro_1038_p", "source_sha256": "c18beb9cdc98cd06030704ff583a6490a78741c0396026c4cd3f9738125d0121", "ja": "それが……可愛い系の路線にしようと思ってたんです。\nでも、もうひと押しインパクトが欲しいな、と……。", "zh": "关于这点……我想让她们走可爱路线。\n但还想再加入一些能给人强烈印象的元素……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_intro_1039_p", "source_sha256": "14134334ab32523f4b402014684785bef08708aadbb9801a8b015952fc7ed194", "ja": "……そうだ。セクシーで可愛い、\n刺激的な小悪魔ユニットなんてどうでしょう？", "zh": "……对了，既性感又可爱，\n让人心跳加速的小恶魔团体怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_intro_1040_president", "source_sha256": "804e50d1127d845e602d13e557b86c2e9ac0ee520f6b654d8d8d1a7241219acb", "ja": "ほほう？　面白そうじゃないか！\nいわゆる、コケティッシュ、というアレだね？", "zh": "哦？听起来很有趣嘛！\n也就是所谓的娇媚风格是吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_intro_1041_p", "source_sha256": "ffacd9380ea503eec6e49cc3fcf566ef8615fdbe42344aeb70eaea5c54ba3818", "ja": "はい、たぶん！", "zh": "是的，大概没错！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_intro_1042_101kot", "source_sha256": "c9b06d34db5c7594df3b48dd58a887c3404617ff9a558fa86ebf165d917d92e4", "ja": "素敵です！　私も、とってもいいと思いますよ♪\nセクシーで可愛い小悪魔たち……。いろいろ捗ります！", "zh": "真是太棒了！我也觉得这是个好主意♪\n性感又可爱的小恶魔们……能往各种方面妄想呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_intro_1043_p", "source_sha256": "3ff1532a2ce89a4f945cb1a112ab76e35732756114f707ce1f5258da316601a1", "ja": "（二人とも期待してくれているらしい。さあ、\n『765PRO ALLSTARS』の、新しい一歩だ！）", "zh": "（两人好像都很期待。\n好，这就是『765PRO ALLSTARS』全新的一步！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
